{
  "response": [
    {
      "id": 0,
      "translated": "Just when I thought the silver tape shot out with a bang, you all appeared from the sky..."
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "translated": "That's just not fair!"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "translated": "Honami told me you'd be appearing from the sky, but I never expected it to look so much like a magic trick."
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "translated": "Yeah."
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "translated": "How did you do that?"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "translated": "We didn't actually appear from the sky, you know."
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "translated": "We were suspended at the very top of the parade float out of sight, and then lowered down all at once."
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "translated": "At the same time, we set up several gas-powered cannons to shoot metallic tape into the air,"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "translated": "making it look as if we suddenly dropped out of the sky."
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "translated": "Wow."
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "translated": "It really is like magic."
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "translated": "Though being suspended up there was a bit scary."
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "translated": "But seeing the audience's reaction made it all worth it."
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "translated": "Right?"
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "translated": "You look so quiet, Kusanagi, but you've actually got a lot of guts."
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "translated": "That's amazing."
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "translated": "Oh,"
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "translated": "that's not true."
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "translated": "Ah, um..."
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "translated": "Oh,"
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "translated": "speaking of which, Hanasato and her group were amazing too, right?"
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "translated": "Yeah."
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "translated": "It's called a call-and-response, right?"
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "translated": "They really got the crowd pumped up with that. It was so cool."
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "translated": "I know, right?"
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "translated": "They really were..."
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "translated": "Wait, huh?"
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "translated": "Where did Haruka and the others go?"
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "translated": "You're right."
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "translated": "Mizuki disappeared before I even noticed, too."
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "translated": "Good work, everyone!"
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "translated": "I heard Rui flubbed his line."
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "translated": "So this is where you all gathered."
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "translated": "You certainly have sharp ears."
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "translated": "Oh, Mizuki, yeah."
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "translated": "And Airi, too."
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "translated": "He stumbled quite a bit."
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "translated": "Ah."
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "translated": "Where were you?"
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "translated": "Kanade."
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "translated": "Oh, we were actually holding a mini handshake event until just now."
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "translated": "A mini handshake event?"
    },
    {
      "id": 42,
      "translated": "Yep."
    },
    {
      "id": 43,
      "translated": "Momojan asked the staff to set aside a space"
    },
    {
      "id": 44,
      "translated": "so they could interact with all their fans."
    },
    {
      "id": 45,
      "translated": "They really know what the fans want."
    },
    {
      "id": 46,
      "translated": "Yeah."
    },
    {
      "id": 47,
      "translated": "Man, I wish I could've gone to that."
    },
    {
      "id": 48,
      "translated": "I wanted to line up for Haruka just to tease her."
    },
    {
      "id": 49,
      "translated": "I'd love to see how she'd react to that."
    },
    {
      "id": 50,
      "translated": "But this time, Minori was the one who was really popular."
    },
    {
      "id": 51,
      "translated": "Really?"
    },
    {
      "id": 52,
      "translated": "Yes."
    },
    {
      "id": 53,
      "translated": "It was incredible."
    },
    {
      "id": 54,
      "translated": "For example..."
    },
    {
      "id": 55,
      "translated": "Yes!"
    },
    {
      "id": 56,
      "translated": "Thank you so much for your support!"
    },
    {
      "id": 57,
      "translated": "I'll keep doing my best!"
    },
    {
      "id": 58,
      "translated": "I'm so glad more people came to the mini handshake event than I expected."
    },
    {
      "id": 59,
      "translated": "Next person, please!"
    }
  ]
}

{
  "response": [
    {
      "id": 0,
      "translated": "Oh."
