    {
      "id": 20,
      "translated": "Oh?"
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "translated": "Ah..."
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "translated": "All the other little kids waiting in line are asking for hugs now too!"
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "translated": "W-what should I do?"
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "translated": "This isn't a handshake event anymore, it's a hugging event!"
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "translated": "And just like that, she was a total hit with the kids."
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "translated": "Ah."
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "translated": "That sounds just like Minori."
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "translated": "That visual is honestly so cute, it makes me laugh."
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "translated": "Man, I'm so proud that my Minori is so popular with the little ones too."
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "translated": "You have no right to be proud, Mizuki."
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "translated": "Mizuki always has a habit of..."
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "translated": "...doing that, don't they?"
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "translated": "Oh, come on, why not?"
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "translated": "As a fan, you just want to be able to say, 'I'm the one who raised her!'"
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "translated": "But seeing that makes me want to be cheered on by little kids and do some fan service too."
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "translated": "Wait, you, Mizuki?"
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "translated": "Yeah."
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "translated": "I mean, given the nature of our group's activities..."
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "translated": "Fan service?"
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "translated": "Well, our activities..."
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "translated": "Did I hear you say fan service?"
    },
    {
      "id": 42,
      "translated": "Ah, well, we..."
    },
    {
      "id": 43,
      "translated": "I see."
    },
    {
      "id": 44,
      "translated": "Uh oh, this is bad."
    },
    {
      "id": 45,
      "translated": "It's true that I'm curious to see what kind of fan service you would do, Mizuki."
    },
    {
      "id": 46,
      "translated": "Hello there."
    },
    {
      "id": 47,
      "translated": "I'm a huge fan of Shinonome."
    },
    {
      "id": 48,
      "translated": "Like,"
    },
    {
      "id": 49,
      "translated": "I really love your passion."
    },
    {
      "id": 50,
      "translated": "I also really love the song 'Cinema'."
    },
    {
      "id": 51,
      "translated": "I mean, 'Cinema'."
    },
    {
      "id": 52,
      "translated": "I really love 'Cinema'."
    },
    {
      "id": 53,
      "translated": "He talks so much."
    },
    {
      "id": 54,
      "translated": "Well,"
    },
    {
      "id": 55,
      "translated": "I actually love those kinds of troublesome fans."
    },
    {
      "id": 56,
      "translated": "Huh?"
    },
    {
      "id": 57,
      "translated": "Huh?"
    },
    {
      "id": 58,
      "translated": "Since you started it, I think you should go through with it."
    },
    {
      "id": 59,
      "translated": "Look, even Kanade is telling you to."
    }
  ]
}

